BT 1 0 0 1 0 47.5 Tm /F1 9 Tf 11.3 TL (Can a short questionnaire recover a poverty rate at lower cost? Tanzanian households were randomly assigned to survey formats,) Tj T* (letting the authors compare model-based estimates with rates from detailed consumption data. Demographics and employment) Tj T* (can recover the poverty rate reasonably well, and results hold across alternative poverty lines, base surveys and inflation) Tj T* (adjustments. The best models need roughly 1,000 households in each survey. Shortened consumption measures need) Tj T* (harmonization, and reliable population rates do not establish which individual households are poor.) Tj T* ET
